  "title": "tvbuff: Use the clamped value for retrieving unaligned le bits",
  "description": "tvb_get_bits64_le allows requesting more than 64 bits, but only\nreturns the 64 least significant bits, clamping the requested\nbits to 64. Use the clamped value when retrieving the initial\nunaligned bits, so that the remaining bits are correct.\n\nShould reduce the number of Clang static analysis warnings, though\nthere still seem to be some false positives.",
